"text": "What is the opposing perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4984,
"char_end": 5058,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s02"
},
{
"start": 1388.7,
"end": 1395.42,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "It all boils down to this: drainage is the most crucial design decision for any trail.",
"char_start": 5071,
"char_end": 5157,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 1395.48,
"end": 1398.48,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox components.",
"char_start": 5158,
"char_end": 5214,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 1398.54,
"end": 1402.92,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 5215,
"char_end": 5304,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s03"
},
{
"start": 1402.92,
"end": 1405.38,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5317,
"char_end": 5354,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 1405.44,
"end": 1409.64,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of trail construction?",
"char_start": 5355,
"char_end": 5416,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 1409.64,
"end": 1416.12,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Honestly, the most common mistake that beginner builders make is digging with too steep a slope.",
"char_start": 5429,
"char_end": 5525,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 1416.18,
"end": 1419.72,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "The framework is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 5526,
"char_end": 5606,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s02"
},
{
"start": 1680.0,
"end": 1685.34,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
"char_start": 5619,
"char_end": 5690,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 1685.34,
"end": 1689.96,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 5703,
"char_end": 5771,
"unit_id": "t0043.u01",
"sent_id": "t0043.s01"
},
{
"start": 1690.02,
"end": 1691.7,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_01",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 5772,
"char_end": 5801,
"unit_id": "t0043.u01",
"sent_id": "t0043.s02"
},
{
"start": 1691.7,
"end": 1695.18,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "And finally, a big thank you to our partners at Linear.",
"char_start": 5814,
"char_end": 5869,
"unit_id": "t0044.u01",
"sent_id": "t0044.s01"
},
{
"start": 1695.24,
"end": 1700.28,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 built for the keyboard.",
"char_start": 5870,
"char_end": 5945,
"unit_id": "t0044.u01",
"sent_id": "t0044.s02"
},
{
"start": 1700.34,
"end": 1701.9,
"speaker_label": "SPEAKER_00",
"text": "Check them out at linear.com.",
"char_start": 5946,
"char_end": 5975,
"unit_id": "t0044.u01",
"sent_id": "t0044.s03"
},
{
"start": 1701.9,
"end": 1704.66,
